☃️Hey snow fans!❄️🌨️ 

Today we present to you the second update to Snow Plowing. You guys have helped us a lot through your submissions. At the moment, we haven't yet managed to fix all your bugs from the submissions, while we are working on the others. In that case - here we go!:.
- fixed problems with computers with 2 graphic cards - many of you had this problem, for example here https://steamcommunity.com/app/2096030/discussions/0/4414172802922754455/ - a few players who tested the beta version of the game confirmed that the bug has already been fixed and the game runs smoothly;
- possibility to wear the Yeti costume;
- fixes with some bugs when saving graphic settings;
- increased variation between tyre types;
- increased effect of clothing on player freezing;
- speed limitation of the vehicle with the plough lowered;
- changed the size of the L02 plough field;
- Snow Blower now uses noticeably fewer calories when in use; https://steamcommunity.com/app/2096030/discussions/0/4351121630176400973/;
- correcting minor bugs and improving mechanics reported by players on Steam and Discord discussions;

- *Preparation of wear and tear on tyres, tools, clothing and ploughs;* IN PROGRESS.
During gameplay, you will see an inscription about the durability of items in the shop, for example. There are these inscriptions already in the game, while the process of durability and wear and tear does NOT work yet - it will be finished and introduced in the next update - screen below.
