Hi snow fans ːtheplanetː :snowflake: :yeti:

Today we present you the first update to Snow Plowing:.

- trapper story looping corrected;
- removed a non-existent character after loading a game save;
- removed trash that cannot be cleared from snow in the Lovers' Car Park;
- added possibility to set an indicator on the road as a destination;
- removed frequent opening of a pop-up with information about the differences between Early Accesses and Full Release;
- added possibility to set FOV and Aspect Ratio;
- fixed a bug with the ESC key in the settings (it crashed the game when clicked);
- fixed player heating in the pickup - it is now possible to warm up in it:snowman:;
- corrected translation of Japanese and Chinese;
- from now on, a handle will appear among the tool icons to symbolise dropping a tool.


Thank you for supporting us 💝:2016yeti::snowflakes:

We also have a suggestion for you - maybe one of you would like to help with language translation? If you communicate in English and other languages (Japanese, Chinese, German, Russian and so on) you are welcome to work with us - together we can do a lot! If any of you would be willing, please write under this post in which language you would be able to help us translate the game. We'll get back to you :)


Also, if you encounter a bug - feel free to report it on our discord:
https://discord.gg/76N77uHWkc
Or by writing on the Steamːthebuilderː discussion board - it helps us a lot in improving the game and making it better.
